# "table lead" (lead track): a line up to C6 with pitch bends that cross the 516 Hz and 1067 Hz mip edges (one-block
# crossfades) and a slow P1 sweep through the sync bank; the voice must be freed after the release.
tempo 132
steps 16
tail 2.0
track lead
preset 140 150 0 90 210 50 0 0 128 0 128 190 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 140 255 4 12
sweep p2 150 190 8 16
note 0 C5 2 127
note 2 D5 2 100
note 4 G4 2 110
bend 5 200
bend 6 0
note 6 B4 2 127
note 8 C6 4 127
bend 9 -200
bend 10 100
bend 11 0
note 12 E5 4 90
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 30
expect peak_below -4
